{% comment %}
  Dragon Diamond LZ-1325 CNC Router Product Page V1
  Source configuration reference: LZ-1325B
{% endcomment %}

<div class="dd-lz1325-product">
  <section class="dd-lz1325-hero" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame dd-lz1325-hero__grid">
      <div class="dd-lz1325-hero__content">
        <p class="dd-lz1325-kicker">01 / PRODUCT PLATFORM · LZ-1325B SOURCE CONFIGURATION</p>
        <h1 id="dd-lz1325-title">LZ-1325 CNC Router</h1>
        <p class="dd-lz1325-hero__lead">Standard-sheet CNC routing for signage, woodworking, panel and display fabrication.</p>

        <dl class="dd-lz1325-hero__facts">
          <div><dt>Working Envelope</dt><dd>1300 × 2500 × 200 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Workholding</dt><dd>Vacuum Table</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Spindle Platform</dt><dd>Air-Cooled Configuration</dd></div>
        </dl>

        <a
          class="dd-lz1325-text-link dd-lz1325-text-link--light"
          href="/pages/contact?source=lz-1325-cnc-router"
          data-track="cta"
          data-cta-id="lz1325_hero_inquiry"
          data-section="lz1325_product_hero"
        >DISCUSS YOUR CONFIGURATION <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>

      <figure class="dd-lz1325-hero__media">
        <img
          src="{{ 'lz-1325b-cnc-router-workshop-front.jpg' | asset_url }}"
          alt="Dragon Diamond LZ-1325B CNC router and controller in the workshop"
          width="1000"
          height="1000"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
        <figcaption>DOCUMENTED MACHINE / SOURCE CONFIGURATION LZ-1325B</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-fit" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-fit-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header">
        <p>02 / PRODUCTION FIT</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-fit-title">Built Around Standard-Sheet Routing</h2>
          <p>The LZ-1325 platform is intended for production teams that need a full-format routing area with configurable workholding and spindle power.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-register dd-lz1325-fit__register">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Signage</h3><p>Acrylic, PVC and routed sign components.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Woodworking</h3><p>Wood and MDF cutting, engraving and shaping.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Furniture & Doors</h3><p>Standard-sheet furniture and door component processing.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Panel Production</h3><p>Decorative panels, display parts and repeatable sheet workflows.</p></article>
        <article><span>05</span><h3>Acrylic / PVC</h3><p>Routing for fabricated letters, profiles and display components.</p></article>
        <article><span>06</span><h3>Craft Production</h3><p>Non-metal molds and routed decorative craft work.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-architecture" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-architecture-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header dd-lz1325-section__header--dark">
        <p>03 / MACHINE ARCHITECTURE</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-architecture-title">A Configurable 1325 Routing Platform</h2>
          <p>The documented architecture combines a 1300 × 2500 mm sheet format, vacuum workholding and rack-and-ball-screw motion.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-architecture__primary">
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-cnc-router-angle-view.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Three-quarter view of the LZ-1325B CNC router architecture" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
        </figure>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Working Envelope</dt><dd>1300 × 2500 × 200 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>X / Y Transmission</dt><dd>Source states “1.5 Mo Rack”</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Z Transmission</dt><dd>Ø25 mm ball screw</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Guide System</dt><dd>20 mm DAJU square rail</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Control</dt><dd>XING DUO WEI controller</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-architecture__views">
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-cnc-router-direct-front.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Direct front view of the LZ-1325B CNC router" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption>FRONT / GANTRY AND TABLE ALIGNMENT</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-cnc-router-side-view.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Side view of the LZ-1325B CNC router" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption>SIDE / FULL ROUTING ENVELOPE</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-configuration" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-configuration-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header">
        <p>04 / WORKHOLDING & ROUTING</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-configuration-title">Configure Holding and Spindle Power to the Work</h2>
          <p>Table and spindle selections are confirmed against material, routing process and production volume. Listed choices are not presented as universal standard equipment.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-configuration__grid">
        <article>
          <figure><img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-vacuum-table-manifold.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="LZ-1325B vacuum table and zoned manifold" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"></figure>
          <span>01 / WORKHOLDING</span>
          <h3>Vacuum Table</h3>
          <p>Zoned vacuum control supports standard-sheet material holding. The primary source states a 7.5 kW vacuum pump; final pump configuration requires confirmation.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <figure><img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-spindle-gantry-detail.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="LZ-1325B spindle and gantry over the vacuum worktable" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"></figure>
          <span>02 / ROUTING HEAD</span>
          <h3>Air-Cooled Spindle Platform</h3>
          <p>Source-listed spindle choices are 3.5, 4.5, 6.0 and 7.5 kW, with a stated maximum spindle speed of 18,000/min.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="dd-lz1325-configuration__text-option">
          <span>03 / TABLE OPTION</span>
          <h3>Alternative Workholding</h3>
          <p>An aluminum T-slot table with PVC is listed as an option. Selection depends on part geometry, material and the required holding method.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="dd-lz1325-configuration__note">FINAL CONFIGURATION IS CONFIRMED AGAINST MATERIAL, WORKING SIZE, ROUTING PROCESS AND WORKHOLDING REQUIREMENT.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-applications" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-applications-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header">
        <p>05 / MATERIALS & APPLICATIONS</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-applications-title">Source-Backed Routing Capability</h2>
          <p>Capability claims below are limited to materials and production contexts documented by the approved product source.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-applications__grid">
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'israel-cnc-production-panel.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="LZ-1325 platform processing a printed event display panel in the Israel workshop" width="1080" height="1920" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption>ISRAEL / LZ-1325 PLATFORM / EVENT & DISPLAY PANEL PRODUCTION</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div>
          <div class="dd-lz1325-materials">
            <p>WOOD</p><p>MDF</p><p>ACRYLIC</p><p>PVC</p><p>NON-METAL MOLDS</p><p>CRAFT MATERIALS</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="dd-lz1325-applications__register">
            <div><dt>Sign Production</dt><dd>Routed letters, profiles and acrylic/PVC components.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Woodworking</dt><dd>Door, furniture and decorative wood component production.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Panel / Display</dt><dd>Sheet-based decorative panels and display components.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Deployment Evidence</dt><dd>Israel evidence separately documents printed event panels, backdrops and display production on an LZ-1325 platform.</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-specifications" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-specifications-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header dd-lz1325-section__header--dark">
        <p>06 / VERIFIED SPECIFICATIONS</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-specifications-title">Documented Technical Dataset</h2>
          <p>Values are taken from the approved LZ-1325B product source. Options remain subject to final configuration confirmation.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-specifications__groups">
        <section aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-spec-group-platform">
          <h3 id="dd-lz1325-spec-group-platform">Platform</h3>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Model Family</dt><dd>LZ-1325</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Source Configuration</dt><dd>LZ-1325B</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Working Area</dt><dd>1300 × 2500 × 200 mm</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Machine Dimensions</dt><dd>3200 × 2100 × 1850 mm</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Package Dimensions</dt><dd>3300 × 2200 × 1850 mm</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Stated Weight</dt><dd>1300 kg</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-spec-group-motion">
          <h3 id="dd-lz1325-spec-group-motion">Motion & Spindle</h3>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>X / Y Transmission</dt><dd>“1.5 Mo Rack” — source wording</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Z Transmission</dt><dd>Ø25 mm ball screw</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Guide Rails</dt><dd>20 mm DAJU square rail</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Spindle Options</dt><dd>3.5 / 4.5 / 6.0 / 7.5 kW air-cooled</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Maximum Spindle Speed</dt><dd>18,000/min</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Motor / Drive</dt><dd>Easy servo / servo motor</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-spec-group-control">
          <h3 id="dd-lz1325-spec-group-control">Control & Electrical</h3>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Controller</dt><dd>XING DUO WEI</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Software</dt><dd>MDRCNC Router</dd></div>
            <div><dt>File Format</dt><dd>G-code</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Computer</dt><dd>Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11, 32 / 64-bit</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Voltage</dt><dd>AC 220V / 380V</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Warranty</dt><dd>2 years</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-spec-group-options">
          <h3 id="dd-lz1325-spec-group-options">Workholding & Options</h3>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Table</dt><dd>Vacuum table</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Vacuum Control</dt><dd>Zoned control</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Vacuum Pump</dt><dd>7.5 kW stated by source; configuration to confirm</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Optional Table</dt><dd>Aluminum T-slot with PVC</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Optional CCD</dt><dd>Automatic edge inspection / contour cutting</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-components" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-components-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header">
        <p>07 / COMPONENT EVIDENCE</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-components-title">Machine Architecture, Documented</h2>
          <p>Primary-source imagery records the spindle, worktable, structure, electrical cabinet, lubrication system and dust-extraction provision.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dd-lz1325-components__grid">
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'lz-1325b-air-cooled-spindle-detail.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="LZ-1325B air-cooled spindle and tool above the vacuum worktable" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption>LZ-1325B / AIR-COOLED SPINDLE AND TOOL DETAIL</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="dd-lz1325-components__register">
          <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Spindle & Gantry</h3><p>Routing head and linear-motion structure shown on the documented machine.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Vacuum Worktable</h3><p>Segmented table surface and zoned workholding architecture.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Electrical Cabinet</h3><p>Dedicated control cabinet is visually documented by the primary source.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Lubrication</h3><p>Oil-pump assembly is shown as component evidence.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>05</span><div><h3>Dust Extraction</h3><p>Dust-collection provision is pictured; standard inclusion and capacity are not claimed.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-section dd-lz1325-deployment" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-deployment-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame">
      <header class="dd-lz1325-section__header dd-lz1325-section__header--dark">
        <p>08 / VERIFIED DEPLOYMENT</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="dd-lz1325-deployment-title">LZ-1325 Platform in Israel</h2>
          <p>The documented deployment follows an LZ-1325 platform from factory verification through delivery and commercial event-decoration production. Exact LZ-1325B equivalence is not asserted.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <article class="dd-lz1325-deployment__record">
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ 'israel-cnc-production-panel.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="LZ-1325 platform routing a decorative panel in the Israel customer workshop" width="1080" height="1920" loading="lazy">
        </figure>
        <div class="dd-lz1325-deployment__index">DEPLOYMENT<br><strong>01</strong></div>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Israel</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>LZ-1325 CNC Router</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Working Area</dt><dd>1300 × 2500 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Application</dt><dd>Event / Display Production</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Production Launched</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a
          class="dd-lz1325-text-link dd-lz1325-text-link--light"
          href="/pages/case-study-israel"
          data-track="cta"
          data-cta-id="lz1325_israel_deployment"
          data-section="lz1325_deployment"
        >VIEW DEPLOYMENT <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dd-lz1325-cta" aria-labelledby="dd-lz1325-cta-title">
    <div class="dd-lz1325-frame dd-lz1325-cta__grid">
      <p>09 / CONFIGURATION INQUIRY</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="dd-lz1325-cta-title">Configure the LZ-1325 for Your Production</h2>
        <p>Share your material, working size, routing process and workholding requirement. The final machine configuration is confirmed against the production task.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Material</li><li>Working Size</li><li>Routing Process</li><li>Workholding</li>
        </ul>
        <a
          class="dd-lz1325-text-link"
          href="/pages/contact?source=lz-1325-cnc-router"
          data-track="cta"
          data-cta-id="lz1325_configuration_inquiry"
          data-section="lz1325_product_cta"
        >DISCUSS YOUR CONFIGURATION <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Product",
    "name": "LZ-1325 CNC Router",
    "description": "LZ-1325 CNC router with a 1300 × 2500 × 200 mm working area, configurable vacuum workholding and air-cooled spindle options for signage and woodworking.",
    "brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": "Dragon Diamond" },
    "model": "LZ-1325",
    "image": {{ 'lz-1325b-cnc-router-studio-front.jpg' | asset_url | prepend: 'https:' | json }}
    {% if product.handle == 'lz-1325-cnc-router' %},
    "url": {{ canonical_url | json }}
    {% endif %}
  }
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .dd-lz1325-product{--dd-lz-cyan:#00a3ad;--dd-lz-dark:#0f1115;--dd-lz-ink:#101317;--dd-lz-line:#c5c9cb;background:#fff;color:var(--dd-lz-ink);font-family:'Archivo Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}
  .dd-lz1325-product *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .dd-lz1325-product img{display:block;max-width:100%}
  .dd-lz1325-frame{width:min(100% - 64px,1240px);margin-inline:auto}
  .dd-lz1325-hero{background:var(--dd-lz-dark);color:#fff;padding:150px 0 72px}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);gap:72px;align-items:end}
  .dd-lz1325-kicker,.dd-lz1325-section__header>p,.dd-lz1325-cta__grid>p{margin:0;color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-hero h1{max-width:9ch;margin:26px 0 0;font-size:clamp(58px,7.2vw,104px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__lead{max-width:590px;margin:30px 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__facts{margin:36px 0 28px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__facts div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17)}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__facts dt,.dd-lz1325-product dt{color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__facts dd,.dd-lz1325-product dd{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__media{margin:0}
  .dd-lz1325-hero__media img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.78) contrast(1.04)}
  .dd-lz1325-product figcaption{margin-top:10px;color:#6c7378;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-hero figcaption{color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)}
  .dd-lz1325-text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;min-height:48px;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;color:var(--dd-lz-ink);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-text-link--light{color:#fff;border-color:var(--dd-lz-cyan)}
  .dd-lz1325-text-link:hover,.dd-lz1325-text-link:focus-visible{color:#007f88}
  .dd-lz1325-text-link--light:hover,.dd-lz1325-text-link--light:focus-visible{color:var(--dd-lz-cyan)}
  .dd-lz1325-text-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px}
  .dd-lz1325-section{padding:112px 0}
  .dd-lz1325-section__header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:32px 64px;padding-bottom:52px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line)}
  .dd-lz1325-section__header h2,.dd-lz1325-cta h2{max-width:19ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,4.8vw,66px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.025em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-section__header div>p,.dd-lz1325-cta div>p{max-width:680px;margin:24px 0 0;color:#596065;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65}
  .dd-lz1325-section__header--dark div>p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)}
  .dd-lz1325-register{display:grid;border-top:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line)}
  .dd-lz1325-fit__register{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:0}
  .dd-lz1325-fit__register article{min-height:220px;padding:30px 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line)}
  .dd-lz1325-fit__register article:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
  .dd-lz1325-register span,.dd-lz1325-configuration article>span{color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:27px;font-weight:700}
  .dd-lz1325-register h3{margin:44px 0 12px;font-size:21px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-register p,.dd-lz1325-configuration article p,.dd-lz1325-components article p{margin:0;color:#5a6165;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture,.dd-lz1325-specifications,.dd-lz1325-deployment{background:var(--dd-lz-dark);color:#fff}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:54px;padding:48px 0}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture figure,.dd-lz1325-architecture__views figure,.dd-lz1325-configuration figure,.dd-lz1325-applications figure,.dd-lz1325-components figure,.dd-lz1325-deployment figure{margin:0;overflow:hidden}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary figure img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary dl{margin:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.23)}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary dl div{padding:19px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary dd{margin-top:8px;font-size:16px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture__views img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover}
  .dd-lz1325-architecture figcaption{color:rgba(255,255,255,.44)}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration{background:#e7eaeb}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid #aeb3b5}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration article{padding:42px 25px 36px;border-right:1px solid #bdc1c3}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration article:first-child{padding-left:0}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration article:last-child{padding-right:0;border-right:0}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration figure{margin-bottom:28px}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration figure img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration h3{margin:15px 0 14px;font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-configuration__note{margin:26px 0 0;color:#485055;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;line-height:1.5}
  .dd-lz1325-applications__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:64px;padding-top:48px}
  .dd-lz1325-applications figure img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%}
  .dd-lz1325-materials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line)}
  .dd-lz1325-materials p{margin:0;padding:18px 14px;border-right:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .dd-lz1325-materials p:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .dd-lz1325-applications__register{margin:42px 0 0}
  .dd-lz1325-applications__register div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px 1fr;padding:17px 0;border-top:1px solid #d2d5d6}
  .dd-lz1325-applications__register dd{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#565e62}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications__groups{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications__groups>section{padding:38px 36px 42px;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications__groups>section:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications h3{margin:0 0 28px;color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications dl{margin:0}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px 1fr;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}
  .dd-lz1325-specifications dd{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}
  .dd-lz1325-components{background:#f1f2f2}
  .dd-lz1325-components__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:60px;padding-top:48px;align-items:start}
  .dd-lz1325-components figure img{width:100%;height:auto}
  .dd-lz1325-product .dd-lz1325-configuration article.dd-lz1325-configuration__text-option{display:block}
  .dd-lz1325-components__register{border-top:1px solid #aeb3b5}
  .dd-lz1325-components article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #bdc1c3}
  .dd-lz1325-components article>span{color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:23px}
  .dd-lz1325-components h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .42fr 1fr .8fr;min-height:320px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record>figure{grid-row:1/3}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record>figure img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__index{padding:32px 20px;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__index strong{color:var(--dd-lz-cyan);font-size:30px}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dl{grid-column:3/5;margin:0;padding:19px 28px;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:125px 1fr;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dl div:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dd{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-deployment__record>a{grid-column:3/5;justify-self:start;margin:0 28px 26px}
  .dd-lz1325-cta{background:var(--dd-lz-cyan);padding:96px 0;color:#071014}
  .dd-lz1325-cta__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:32px 64px}
  .dd-lz1325-cta__grid>p{color:#071014}
  .dd-lz1325-cta div>p{color:#17383b}
  .dd-lz1325-cta ul{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 28px;margin:24px 0 25px;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .dd-lz1325-cta li::before{content:'//';margin-right:8px}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .dd-lz1325-hero__grid,.dd-lz1325-section__header,.dd-lz1325-cta__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-hero__grid{gap:46px}
    .dd-lz1325-fit__register{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .dd-lz1325-fit__register article:nth-child(3n){border-right:1px solid var(--dd-lz-line)}
    .dd-lz1325-fit__register article:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article,.dd-lz1325-configuration article:first-child,.dd-lz1325-configuration article:last-child{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);gap:0 28px;padding:30px 0;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #bdc1c3}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article figure{grid-row:1/5;margin:0}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article>span,.dd-lz1325-configuration article h3,.dd-lz1325-configuration article p{grid-column:2}
  }
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .dd-lz1325-frame{width:min(100% - 40px,1240px)}
    .dd-lz1325-hero{padding:120px 0 54px}
    .dd-lz1325-hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,16vw,72px)}
    .dd-lz1325-hero__facts div{grid-template-columns:120px 1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-section{padding:78px 0}
    .dd-lz1325-section__header{padding-bottom:38px}
    .dd-lz1325-fit__register{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-fit__register article,.dd-lz1325-fit__register article:nth-child(3n){min-height:0;padding:24px 0;border-right:0}
    .dd-lz1325-register h3{margin:18px 0 10px}
    .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary,.dd-lz1325-architecture__views,.dd-lz1325-applications__grid,.dd-lz1325-components__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-architecture__primary{gap:28px}
    .dd-lz1325-architecture__views{gap:34px}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article,.dd-lz1325-configuration article:first-child,.dd-lz1325-configuration article:last-child{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article figure{grid-row:auto;margin-bottom:24px}
    .dd-lz1325-configuration article>span,.dd-lz1325-configuration article h3,.dd-lz1325-configuration article p{grid-column:1}
    .dd-lz1325-applications__grid,.dd-lz1325-components__grid{gap:36px}
    .dd-lz1325-applications__register div{grid-template-columns:105px 1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-specifications__groups{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dd-lz1325-specifications__groups>section,.dd-lz1325-specifications__groups>section:nth-child(2n){padding:30px 0;border-right:0}
    .dd-lz1325-specifications dl div{grid-template-columns:120px minmax(0,1fr)}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__record{grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr);padding-bottom:28px}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__record>figure{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:auto;aspect-ratio:16/10;margin-bottom:20px}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__index{grid-column:1;grid-row:2/4;padding:15px 10px 0 0;border-left:0}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dl{grid-column:2;padding:0 0 0 18px}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__record dl div{grid-template-columns:95px minmax(0,1fr)}
    .dd-lz1325-deployment__record>a{grid-column:2;margin:18px 0 0 18px}
    .dd-lz1325-cta{padding:72px 0}
    .dd-lz1325-cta ul{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

